  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0 - Initial Release\n• Peer-to-peer mesh networking with auto-discovery\n• UDP broadcast-based peer discovery\n• TCP reliable messaging with JSON serialization\n• Pre-shared key authentication\n• Bidirectional text messaging\n• Connection/disconnection detection\n• Event-driven architecture\n• 100% test coverage (176/176 tests passing)\n• Interactive demo application included",
